BT /F1 9.25 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 72.00 598.70 Tm (Salt: a unique random value for each password hash. It prevents identical passwords from producing identical) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.25 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 72.00 585.90 Tm (stored hashes and defeats precomputed tables. The salt is normally stored with the hash.) Tj ET
