BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 750.00 Tm (Cryptographic validation can. The application may still load a user, permissions, revocation status, or resource) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 736.90 Tm (ownership from a database.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.80 Tf 0.075 0.360 0.580 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 709.80 Tm (Can a user modify a JWT?) Tj ET
