BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 676.70 Tm (exploit a verifier flaw.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.80 Tf 0.075 0.360 0.580 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 649.60 Tm (How do you revoke a JWT immediately?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 629.60 Tm (Introduce state, such as a denylist, token version, valid-after timestamp, or introspection. Otherwise, a valid access) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 616.50 Tm (token lives until expiration.) Tj ET
