BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.20 Tm (should be checked against current server state.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.80 Tf 0.075 0.360 0.580 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 482.10 Tm (Does JWT eliminate CSRF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 462.10 Tm (Not inherently. An Authorization header manually added by application code reduces classic CSRF exposure. A JWT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.45 Tf 0.180 0.200 0.230 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 449.00 Tm (automatically sent in a cookie still requires CSRF defenses.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.80 Tf 0.075 0.360 0.580 rg 1 0 0 1 54.00 421.90 Tm (Does HttpOnly eliminate XSS?) Tj ET
